OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies in motorway crash after
OL,4,A'rolling road block'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man died after two vehicles collided
OL,7,Fat the back of a rolling police road
OL,8,Fblock that had been put in place
OL,9,Fbecause of debris on a motorway.
OL,11,FTraffic was slowed on the M5 between
OL,12,FTaunton and Bridgwater in Somerset on
OL,13,FTuesday at around 13.10 BST due to the
OL,14,Fdebris, and the crash happened soon
OL,15,Fafterwards at the rear of the queue.
OL,17,FThe motorway remained closed southbound
OL,18,Ffor several hours and northbound until
OL,19,Fmidnight, allowing specialist officers
OL,20,Fto collect forensic evidence.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
