OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies in motorway crash after
OL,4,A'rolling road block'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAvon and Somerset Police said the man's
OL,7,Ffamily had been informed of his death
OL,8,Fand officers want to hear from any
OL,9,Fwitnesses or drivers with dashcam
OL,10,Ffootage.
